  "note": "P1: direction/origin. do + Gen (to), z + Gen (from). Not static w/na. Motion chunk Ide/Idziesz/Wracam/Wracasz taught here (full verbs later). ze sklepu (not z sklepu).",
  "focus_structures": [
    "prep_do_gen",
    "prep_z_gen"
  ],
  "intro": [
    {
      "title": "Going to / coming from",
      "title_pl": "Kierunek i pochodzenie",
      "body": "Static place was w/na + locative.\n\nDirection uses different prepositions and usually the genitive:\n· do + Gen = to / into (do domu, do sklepu, do miasta)\n· z + Gen = from / out of (z domu, ze sklepu, z miasta)\n\nDo not mix: w domu (location) ≠ do domu (destination).",
      "body_pl": "Statycznie: w/na + miejscownik. Kierunek: do / z + dopełniacz."
    },
    {
      "title": "do / z · closed set",
      "table": {
        "headers": [
          "Nom",
          "do + Gen",
          "z + Gen"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "dom",
            "do domu",
            "z domu"
          ],
          [
            "sklep",
            "do sklepu",
            "ze sklepu"
          ],
          [
            "miasto",
            "do miasta",
            "z miasta"
          ],
          [
            "szkoła",
            "do szkoły",
            "ze szkoły"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "body": "Note ze szkoły and ze sklepu — z becomes ze before an s-cluster. Learn these as fixed forms."
    },
    {
      "title": "Idę · Wracam (chunk)",
      "title_pl": "Idę · Wracam (zwrot)",
      "body": "To actually use do and z, you need two motion words. Take these four forms as ready-made chunks — the full verbs come later:\n\nIdę do... = I'm going to...\nIdziesz do...? = are you going to...?\nWracam z... = I'm coming back from...\nWracasz z...? = are you coming back from...?\n\nIdę do domu. · Wracam ze szkoły.",
      "body_pl": "Cztery gotowe formy: Idę / Idziesz (do...), Wracam / Wracasz (z...). Całe czasowniki później.",
      "table": {
        "headers": [
          "Chunk",
          "English",
          "Example"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "Idę do...",
            "I'm going to...",
            "Idę do sklepu."
          ],
          [
            "Idziesz do...?",
            "are you going to...?",
            "Idziesz do szkoły?"
          ],
          [
            "Wracam z...",
            "I'm coming back from...",
            "Wracam z miasta."
          ],
          [
            "Wracasz z...?",
            "are you coming back from...?",
            "Wracasz ze szkoły?"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
